OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to man, 24, who died
OL,4,Aduring Cardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to an "active,
OL,7,Ffit and full of life" runner who died
OL,8,Fduring the Cardiff Half Marathon.
OL,10,FEvent organisers Run4Wales said Ross
OL,11,FWilliams-Griffiths, 24, from Bargoed,
OL,12,FCaerphilly, suffered a sudden cardiac
OL,13,Farrest during the event on 4 October.
OL,15,FIt said Ross ran the half marathon with
OL,16,Fhis girlfriend Katie, with the pair
OL,17,Fknown affectionately as "Team
OL,18,FGriff-Bow", for Welsh cancer charity
OL,19,FTenovus Cancer Care.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
