OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to man, 24, who died
OL,4,Aduring Cardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family said Ross was "kind, caring
OL,7,Fand full of life, and brought laughter,
OL,8,Floyalty and warmth wherever he went".
